#: src/Admin/settlements/components/MollieImportPanel.js:203
msgid "“Load new” brings in the settlements of the connected organization that are not saved here yet, with their payments, captures, refunds and chargebacks. Settlements already loaded from Mollie are left unchanged. “Reload all” retrieves every settlement again, which takes longer and is only needed when saved data looks wrong."
